{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Elysium!</strong>\u2014a co-op sci-fi survival on a shattered island group: explore, build, craft and face corrupted Elythian guardians to determine the fate of a fallen utopia</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_revive_fallen_utopia.png?t=1750022832\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/Wishlist_Elysium_Today__5_.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reactivate silent towers and forgotten terminals to bring bridges, transit lines, and whole districts back online. Every structure reactivated reshapes the island\u2014and brings you one step closer to restoring what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_fight_machines_mutated.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/GIF_FigtMachinesMutants.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reactivated power lures two kinds of danger: Elythian guardians gone rogue and wildlife mutated by Elysiorite radiation. Read attack patterns, dodge hard, and strike with whatever firepower you\u2019ve scraped together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_Build_Your_Base.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/GIF_Build.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your spot\u2014riverside, cliffside, or deep in the forest\u2014and start small. Snap together wooden walls, floors, and ramps. Reinforce, expand, and transform your shelter into a forward base built to withstand anything the island throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_Every_Path_Tells.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/GIF_EveryPathTellsAStory.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every path leads to something worth finding. From observatories to healing shrines, each landmark offers new materials, shortcuts, or fragments of Elythian history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_Mind_Beneath_the_Ruins.png?t=1750022832\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/Mind_Beneath_the_Ruins_GIF.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you bring ancient systems back online, strange patterns begin to emerge. Locked doors resist, towers trigger automated defenses, and corrupted guardians activate with unnatural timing. Something\u2014once central to this world\u2014is still watching. Once a guiding intelligence, it now lingers deep within the island\u2019s bones, resisting your every step forward. Whether it\u2019s protecting what remains\u2026 or hiding what went wrong\u2026 is yours to uncover.<br><br><strong>WISHLIST ELYSIUM TO FOLLOW THE JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The island is waking up. Be there when it does.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2354810?t=1750022832","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750022832","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/fca4de7225d5d40ab63df8e93727f202886abc09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750022832","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/fca4de7225d5d40ab63df8e93727f202886abc09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750022832","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Elysium!</strong>\u2014a co-op sci-fi survival on a shattered island group: explore, build, craft and face corrupted Elythian guardians to determine the fate of a fallen utopia</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_revive_fallen_utopia.png?t=1750022832\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/Wishlist_Elysium_Today__5_.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reactivate silent towers and forgotten terminals to bring bridges, transit lines, and whole districts back online. Every structure reactivated reshapes the island\u2014and brings you one step closer to restoring what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_fight_machines_mutated.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/GIF_FigtMachinesMutants.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reactivated power lures two kinds of danger: Elythian guardians gone rogue and wildlife mutated by Elysiorite radiation. Read attack patterns, dodge hard, and strike with whatever firepower you\u2019ve scraped together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_Build_Your_Base.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/GIF_Build.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your spot\u2014riverside, cliffside, or deep in the forest\u2014and start small. Snap together wooden walls, floors, and ramps. Reinforce, expand, and transform your shelter into a forward base built to withstand anything the island throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_Every_Path_Tells.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/GIF_EveryPathTellsAStory.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every path leads to something worth finding. From observatories to healing shrines, each landmark offers new materials, shortcuts, or fragments of Elythian history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/banner_EN_Mind_Beneath_the_Ruins.png?t=1750022832\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/Mind_Beneath_the_Ruins_GIF.gif?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/extras/steam_divider.png?t=1750022832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you bring ancient systems back online, strange patterns begin to emerge. Locked doors resist, towers trigger automated defenses, and corrupted guardians activate with unnatural timing. Something\u2014once central to this world\u2014is still watching. Once a guiding intelligence, it now lingers deep within the island\u2019s bones, resisting your every step forward. Whether it\u2019s protecting what remains\u2026 or hiding what went wrong\u2026 is yours to uncover.<br><br><strong>WISHLIST ELYSIUM TO FOLLOW THE JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The island is waking up. Be there when it does.</p>","developers":["Artifika Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/header.jpg?t=1750022832","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Elysium","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 3.3GHz or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Artifika Games","ATOM"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/bec0428ec386a37552710858665144a3b569e355/ss_bec0428ec386a37552710858665144a3b569e355.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750022832","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354810/bec0428ec38